    "message": "feat(ui): wire up receive/scan/bridge/settings pages with real routes & wallet init guard\n\n- HomePage quick actions switch bottom tabs instead of broken /receive route\n- WalletInitPage: bootstrap check redirects initialized wallets to home\n- ReceivePage: clipboard copy wired, independent from home_page duplicate\n- ScanPage: validates rcpu URI via PaymentService before confirm dialog\n- BridgePage: typed DerivedAddresses, deposit/redeem tabs\n- SettingsPage: address management sections\n- router: dedupe /receive & /scan routes; keep all feature routes\n- wallet_state: reuse di.dart secureStoreProvider (no duplicate)",
